  "notes": [
    "The timed final interleave and sum module snapshots byte-match the adopted source. The measurement host crate was version 0.2.0; the timed final engine modules are the adopted 0.3.0 source. Only SamplingDetail comes from the public host crate; Seq/Order wrappers are excluded.",
    "The baseline profile differs from the original only in its import path to the preserved baseline compensated arithmetic module.",
    "Paired measurements alternate two implementations for five samples calibrated to at least 20 ms. The swapped-module controls report raw baseline/candidate ratios, which must be inverted to express candidate/baseline.",
    "Positioned walking excludes seeking; construction includes allocation and destruction. Fresh seek plus first item excludes construction. Source I/O, shuffling, and public wrappers are not measured.",
